CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/ap com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/UnitTurretInstance
	COMMENT Per-turret runtime state stored in a unit's turret array. angle is the current turret angle; reset(float) initializes idleBaseAngle to the same supplied angle. currentTurnRate is the signed turn-rate state used by the accelerated turnTurretTowards path; other paths may leave its previous value unchanged. turnDelay is tested by isTurnDelayExpired() (== 0) and hasNegativeTurnDelay() (< 0), and adjusted by extendTurnDelay(int) and forceNegativeTurnDelay(int). reloadTimer and warmupTimer hold firing timing state. reset(float) sets angle and idleBaseAngle to its argument and clears all other fields to zero, false or null.
	FIELD a angle F
	FIELD b idleBaseAngle F
	FIELD c currentTurnRate F
	FIELD d turnDelay F
	FIELD e reloadTimer F
	FIELD f warmupTimer F
	FIELD g aimAligned Z
	FIELD h aimOffsetX F
	FIELD i aimOffsetY F
	FIELD j target Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;
	FIELD k idleSweepElapsed F
	FIELD l idleSweepOffset F
	FIELD m alternateShot Z
	METHOD a isTurnDelayExpired ()Z
	METHOD a reset (F)V
	METHOD a extendTurnDelay (I)V
	METHOD b hasNegativeTurnDelay ()Z
	METHOD b forceNegativeTurnDelay (I)V
